@HostAddress = http://localhost:5206

### Weather forecast
GET {{HostAddress}}/weatherforecast

### Products - Get all
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Products

### Products - Get by id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Products/4

### Products - Create
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "price": 999.99,
  "stock": 25,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-01T10:00:00",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Products - Update
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/Products/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 9,
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stock": 15,
  "createdAt": "2026-09-01T10:00:00",
  "categoryId": 3
}

### Products - Delete
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Products/4

### Categories - Get all
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories

### Categories - Get by id
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories/1

### Categories - Create
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Devices and accessories"
}

### Categories - Update
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Electronics Updated",
  "description": "Updated devices and accessories"
}

### Categories - Delete
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Categories/1

